Package: argon-oneup-suite
Version: 1.4.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: GamingTux <gamingtux@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/GamingTux/argon-oneup-suite
Depends: argon-oneup-essentials (>= 1.4.1), argon-oneup-backlight (>= 1.3.4), argon-oneup-battery (>= 1.3.4), argon-oneup-lid (>= 1.3.4), argon-oneup-sensors (>= 1.3.4), argon-oneup-power-profiles (>= 1.3.4), rpi-suspend (>= 1.5.0), rpi-vc4-edp (>= 1.1.1), cm5-mmc-fix (>= 1.3.4)
Suggests: argon-oneup-plasma-widget (>= 1.3.4), ksystemstats-rpi5-fix (>= 1.3.4), rpi-pishutdown (>= 1.3.4), argon-wfplug-batt (>= 1.3.4)
Description: Complete hardware support suite for Argon ONE UP laptop
 Metapackage that installs all core hardware drivers, services, and utilities for the
 Argon ONE UP laptop (based on Raspberry Pi 5 / Compute Module 5).
 Includes hardware essentials (antenna, NVMe Gen 3, blower fan curve, I2C, APT repo),
 battery telemetry (CW2217), DDC/CI display backlight, magnetic lid switch,
 power profiles daemon, standard lm-sensors hardware configuration,
 rpi-suspend userspace sleep/standby manager, rpi-vc4-edp display patcher, and
 cm5-mmc-fix empty microSD slot shutdown fix.
 Fully system-agnostic: works across all Linux distributions and desktop environments.
 Optional extensions (KDE widgets and Pi OS dialogs)
 are available as separate packages in extras.
